# marked linguist-vendored or linguist-generated, so a re-vendor or a
# regeneration that grows a file over 5000 tokens does not block its own
# commit. Mark only files a script writes whole: hand-written files that a
# generator splices into (router SKILL.md member tables, .claude/settings.json)
# stay unmarked. Symlinks are not listed: their blob is a short target path.
